  "details": "I love the new group sharing feature and find it great that you can just plop a group down on the ground for multiple people to see.\n\nHowever... group owners should have the ability to role-restrict the ability to share *other groups* in any type of group instance. This would discourage poaching of members from similar groups and prevent unsavory groups (of which there are many multitudes) from being shared in the group instance, while still allowing the group running the instance to still be displayed.\n\nI feel that it should be a role setting rather than pedestal on/off instance switch, because the group should still be able to put down *their own* pedestal.",
